# Real Apache Basic Auth — blocks unauthenticated requests before any PHP
# in this directory ever runs (the same "gate before the handler" guarantee
# src/middleware.ts used to provide). Covers /admin/endorsements,
# /admin/endorsements/{id}, and /api/admin/* (all rewritten into this
# directory by ../../.htaccess).
#
# {{REPO_ROOT}} is substituted with the real absolute path by
# deploy/hooks/post-merge on every deploy — AuthUserFile needs an absolute
# path and this repo's checkout location varies by environment. Left as a
# literal placeholder here (harmless no-op) if this .htaccess is ever served
# without going through that hook, e.g. `astro build` run standalone.
AuthType Basic
AuthName "BitcoinIs.Money admin"
AuthUserFile {{REPO_ROOT}}/.htpasswd
Require valid-user
